WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.230
Some flowers are big,
bright and scented,

2
00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.490
and full of sweet nectar.

3
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:10.090
Others are small, dull and
feathery, with no scent at all.

4
00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:14.010
Yet both kinds of flower are
doing exactly the same job.

5
00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:16.270
So why do they look so different?

6
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:19.790
In this mission, you'll take a
flower apart and name its male

7
00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.060
and female parts.

8
00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:25.480
You'll compare two very different
flower designs, part by part.

9
00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.570
You'll follow pollen
from anther to stigma,

10
00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.610
then on to seeds and fruit.

11
00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:34.270
And you'll find out what
a seed needs to germinate.

12
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:38.370
Your mission: explain why two
flowers doing the same job look

13
00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:39.850
so different.
